  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Это правда, она никогда не кричит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That is true, she never yells.' Notice how naturally this everyday Russian phrase expresses the speaker's point.",
   "gap": 0.4
